&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience as a Lead or Principal Artist in the gaming industry, with a strong portfolio demonstrating artistic excellence and creative ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with AI-assisted art creation and a passion for exploring emerging creative technologies, combining technical expertise with 2D and 3D mastery to deliver compelling visual styles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional artistic skills and hands-on expertise across both 2D and 3D art production.&lt;/li&gt;
