&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Telnyx&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Telnyx is an industry leader that&#39;s not just imagining the future of global connectivity—we&#39;re building it. From architecting and amplifying the reach of a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://telnyx.com/our-network&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;private, global, multi-cloud IP network&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;, to bringing &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://telnyx.com/resources/about-edge-connectivity&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;hyperlocal edge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; technology right to your fingertips through intuitive APIs, we&#39;re shaping a new era of seamless interconnection between people, devices, and applications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re driven by a desire to transform and modernize what&#39;s antiquated, automate the manual, and solve real-world problems through innovative connectivity solutions. As a testament to our success, we&#39;re proud to stand as a financially stable and profitable company. Our robust profitability allows us not only to invest in pioneering technologies but also to foster an environment of continuous learning and growth for our team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our collective vision is a world where borderless connectivity fuels limitless innovation. By joining us, you can be part of laying the foundations for this interconnected future. We&#39;re currently seeking passionate individuals who are excited about the opportunity to contribute to an industry-shaping company while growing their own skills and careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Most sales roles chase new logos. This one unlocks the revenue already inside Telnyx&#39;s customer base — and there&#39;s a lot of it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Growth Account Executive (Expansion)&lt;/strong&gt;, you&#39;ll take commercial ownership of established Telnyx customers after their first 12 months, identifying and closing new revenue opportunities across our product portfolio, from Voice AI and programmable communications to messaging, connectivity, and AI infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll own an assigned portfolio of existing customers, identify untapped opportunities, build relationships with new stakeholders, and drive expansion from prospecting through close.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This isn&#39;t traditional account management. You&#39;re not here to simply maintain relationships or renew contracts. You&#39;re here to grow accounts by introducing new products, expanding into new business units and geographies, and helping customers build more with Telnyx.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re not farming. You&#39;re hunting inside the base.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own and grow your accounts.&lt;/strong&gt; Take commercial ownership of an assigned portfolio of established customers, developing strategies to drive incremental recurring revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Find untapped opportunities.&lt;/strong&gt; Analyze customer usage, product adoption, business models, and growth plans to identify opportunities for cross-selling, upselling, and geographic expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hunt within existing accounts.&lt;/strong&gt; Run targeted, personalized outbound campaigns to engage new stakeholders, departments, and decision-makers within your customer portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the expansion sales cycle.&lt;/strong&gt; Lead discovery, qualify opportunities, develop commercial proposals, negotiate terms, and close expansion deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sell across the Telnyx product portfolio.&lt;/strong&gt; Identify opportunities spanning Voice AI, SIP trunking, programmable voice, messaging, WhatsApp Business, global numbers, wireless, and AI infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build strategic relationships.&lt;/strong&gt; Develop connections with technical buyers, business leaders, and economic decision-makers to uncover new use cases and accelerate adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive measurable revenue growth.&lt;/strong&gt; Own an incremental MRR target, focusing on commercially attributable, profitable expansion rather than organic usage growth alone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate across teams.&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with Hunter AEs during account transitions and partner with Solutions Engineering, Customer Success, and Product teams to execute expansion strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own your forecast.&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain accurate opportunities, account plans, and forecasts in Salesforce, ensuring clear visibility into pipeline health and commercial progress.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring customer intelligence back to Telnyx.&lt;/strong&gt; Share market insights, product feedback, and emerging customer requirements to help shape our roadmap and go-to-market strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in B2B technology sales, ideally as an Account Executive, Growth AE, or in a commercially focused business development role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A demonstrated ability to generate pipeline through proactive outbound prospecting rather than relying exclusively on inbound demand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A hunter mentality and the commercial curiosity to identify opportunities that aren&#39;t immediately obvious.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong discovery and consultative selling skills, with the ability to connect technical capabilities to measurable business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience navigating multiple stakeholders and building relationships with both technical and commercial decision-makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to independently manage opportunities, develop business cases, and move deals through a structured sales process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong account research and strategic thinking skills, including identifying whitespace and opportunities for cross-selling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort discussing technical products with developers, engineering teams, operations leaders, and executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing pipeline and forecasts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive, accountable mindset with a genuine desire to own and deliver revenue results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in CPaaS, UCaaS, telecom, cloud infrastructure, AI, or developer-focused technology platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Voice AI, SIP trunking, programmable communications, WhatsApp Business API, or messaging infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous success in an expansion, cross-sell, upsell, or account-growth role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling multiple products or solutions into the same organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with MEDDPICC or another structured qualification methodology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with international or multinational customers across Europe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why This Role Matters&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Telnyx customers are already building on our infrastructure, but many are only using a fraction of what our platform can offer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A customer using us for SIP trunking might be a strong fit for Voice AI. A business operating in one country might be ready to expand across Europe. These opportunities don&#39;t always arrive as inbound requests. Someone needs to uncover them, build the business case, and turn them into revenue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;That&#39;s where you come in. You&#39;ll work on a warm base with real relationships, real usage data, and real expansion potential. The upside is there. You just have to go and find it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be measured on the incremental revenue you create, not simply the accounts you inherit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Telnyx&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real technology, built in-house.&lt;/strong&gt; We own our global network and build our communications and AI infrastructure, giving you a differentiated platform to sell.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A broad portfolio with real cross-sell potential.&lt;/strong&gt; From global connectivity and programmable communications to Voice AI and AI infrastructure, there&#39;s always another customer challenge we can solve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profitable and independent.&lt;/strong&gt; Join a company focused on sustainable growth and long-term investment in its technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h6&gt;#LI-RH1&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a hands-on Senior Data Platform Engineer to build and scale enterprise data services centered on SingleStore Helios and PostgreSQL. You will combine database architecture and production engineering with data pipeline development, data curation, platform migrations, self-service enablement and cost optimization. You will work with teams across regions to deliver reliable, well-governed data services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, develop and optimize SingleStore and PostgreSQL schemas, SQL queries, physical data models, indexing and workload performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain reliable batch, streaming and CDC ingestion pipelines from relational databases, object storage and other enterprise sources into SingleStore; implement validation, transformation, enrichment and data curation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical assessments and migrations of existing applications and data workloads to SingleStore, while onboarding new teams, applications and services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build reusable self-service onboarding capabilities, including APIs, configuration templates, automated provisioning, access requests, pipeline deployment and operational guardrails.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize cloud database spend through workload right-sizing, consolidation, scheduling and performance tuning; develop transparent SingleStore cluster, application and team-level cost allocation and showback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own production readiness and database reliability: monitoring, incident triage, root-cause analysis, recoverability, deployment controls and collaboration with SingleStore Helios support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate data quality, lineage, ownership and access controls into delivery workflows; work with the enterprise data catalog and governance teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create engineering standards, CI/CD pipelines, automated tests, documentation and cross-region handoffs that reduce manual operational work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of hands-on experience in data platform engineering, database engineering or closely related production data roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced SQL and PostgreSQL expertise, including query plans, schema design, performance tuning and operational troubleshooting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Python and practical experience developing production-grade ingestion and transformation pipelines, with testing and observability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with distributed or cloud-managed databases and modern data integration patterns, including batch and CDC; familiarity with cloud object storage as an ingestion and staging layer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to own end-to-end technical delivery, collaborate with application teams and solve complex production issues independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;d love if you had&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on SingleStore (MemSQL) or SingleStore Helios experience, including pipelines, performance tuning and workload design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kafka or similar streaming platforms, infrastructure as code, CI/CD and API-driven platform automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building self-service data platforms, data quality frameworks, metadata/catalog integrations and chargeback/showback reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with cloud FinOps, database migrations or financial-services enterprise data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Schonfeld is a global multi-manager hedge fund that strives to deliver industry-leading risk-adjusted returns for our investors. We leverage both internal and external portfolio manager teams around the world, seeking to capitalize on inefficiencies and opportunities within the markets. We draw from decades of experience and a significant investment in proprietary technology, infrastructure and risk analytics to invest across four main strategies: Quant, Tactical, Fundamental Equity and Discretionary Macro &amp;amp; Fixed Income.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Culture &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;At Schonfeld, we’ll invest in you. Attracting and retaining top talent is at the heart of what we do, because we believe that exceptional outcomes begin with exceptional people. We foster a culture where talent is empowered to continually learn, innovate and pursue ambitious goals. We are teamwork-oriented, collaborative and encourage ideas—at all levels—to be shared. As an organization committed to investing in our people, we provide learning and educational offerings and opportunities to make an impact. We encourage community through internal networks, external partnerships and service initiatives that promote inclusion and purpose beyond the firm’s walls.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
